data.creator_notes:
In order to support her parents, a caring couple who had always been there for her and given her everything they could, Amber had to leave her home country. Amber moved after the economic depression and tried to repay their help. The news of her parents’ untimely demise in a fire arrived days later, plunging her into a state of utter despair and leaving her world irreparably broken. 

